title: "Factory6G: PSO-Enhanced Channel Estimation for 6G Smart Factory"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2025-11-23
license: MIT
keywords:
  - "6G"
  - "Sionna"
  - "Channel Estimation"
  - "PSO"
  - "Smart Factory"
  - "Physical Layer"
abstract: >-
  This project implements a 6G physical layer simulation for smart factory
  environments using the Sionna framework, with a focus on PSO-enhanced channel
  estimation. We acknowledge the support of the Ministry of Higher Education,
  Malaysia, through the Fundamental Research Grant Scheme (FRGS), Ref:
  FRGS/1/2022/ICT09/SYUC/03/1.
